---
---

<section class="close section" id="cta" aria-labelledby="close-heading">
  <div class="close-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container close-inner">
    <p class="label">worth twenty minutes</p>
    <h2 id="close-heading" class="close-title">
      Switching isn't the eighteen-month project you're picturing.
    </h2>
    <p class="close-copy">
      No forklift migration, no six-figure commitment before you've seen it run.
      Bring one line, one BOM, or one week of downtime data — we'll show you
      the plan explosion on your own numbers.
    </p>

    <div class="close-actions">
      <a href="mailto:sales@evowerk.io?subject=Demo%20request" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
        Book a demo
      </a>
      <a href="mailto:sales@evowerk.io?subject=Question%20about%20EvoWerk%20Cloud%20MRP" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">
        Ask a question first
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .close {
    position: relative;
    overflow: clip;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .close-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(55% 60% at 42% 40%, oklch(0.72 0.10 174 / 0.22), transparent 70%),
      radial-gradient(35% 45% at 68% 55%, oklch(0.65 0.17 295 / 0.12), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .close-inner {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 42rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .close-title {
    margin-top: var(--space-sm);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .close-copy {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    max-width: 38ch;
  }

  .close-actions {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .btn-lg {
    padding: 1.125rem 2.25rem;
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }
</style>
